    { "^Increases Stamina by ([%d%.]+) for ([%d%.]+) min and gets you drunk to boot%. Green means it's good!%.?$", "耐力提高%1点，持续%2分钟，顺便让你喝醉。绿色代表好东西！" },
    { "^Reduces the crafting time of Smelt Copper, Smelt Tin, Smelt Bronze, and Smelt Silver by ([%d%.]+)%%%.?$", "熔炼铜、熔炼锡、熔炼青铜和熔炼银的制作时间缩短%1%%" },
    { "^%(([%d%.]+)%) Set: Your spellcasts have a ([%d%.]+)%% chance to heal you for ([%d%.]+) to ([%d%.]+)%.?$", "（%1 件）套装：你施法时有%2%%的几率为你恢复%3到%4点生命值" },
    { "^Increases movement speed by ([%d%.]+)%% in Tirisfal Glades, Silverpine Forest, and Shadowfang Keep%.?$", "在提瑞斯法林地、银松森林和影牙城堡中，移动速度提高%1%%" },
    { "^Increases Spirit by ([%d%.]+), but decreases Intelligence by ([%d%.]+) for ([%d%.]+) min Smoooooth%.?$", "精神提高%1点，但智力降低%2点，持续%3分钟。顺——滑——" },
    { "^\"Teaches you how to permanently enchant a two%-handed weapon so it grants %+([%d%.]+) Intellect%.\"%.?$", "“教你学会给一件双手武器永久性地附魔，使它获得+%1智力的效果。”" },
    { "^Transfers ([%d%.]+) health every ([%d%.]+) seconds from the target to the caster for ([%d%.]+) sec%.?$", "命中率： 每%2秒钟吸取目标%1点生命值，并将其转移给施法者，持续%3秒" },
    { "^Slice open and gather from a target Copper, Tin, Silver, or Iron Vein %(does not require Mining%)%.?$", "劈开目标铜矿脉、锡矿脉、银矿脉或铁矿脉并采集（不需要采矿技能）" },
    { "^Summons an Eye of Kilrogg and binds your vision to it%. The eye moves quickly but is very fragile%.?$", "召唤一颗基尔罗格之眼，并让你以它的视角观察世界。基尔罗格之眼速度很快，但也非常脆弱" },
    { "^\"Teaches you how to permanently enchant a two%-handed weapon to do ([%d%.]+) additional damage%.\"%.?$", "“教你学会给一件双手武器永久性地附魔，使它可以造成%1点的额外伤害。”" },
    { "^Permanently enchant a melee weapon to often steal life from the enemy and give it to the wielder%.?$", "永久性地附魔一把近战武器，使其经常从敌人身上偷取生命值并转给持有者" },
    { "^Harness the power of lightning to strike down all enemies around you for ([%d%.]+) Nature damage%.?$", "以闪电的能量击倒你附近的所有敌人，对它们造成%1点自然伤害" },
